WEBVTT

00:00:06.420 --> 00:00:07.630
Ranko...

00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:28.250
Welcome home, Master

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:30.330
Welcome home, Mistress

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:35.330
Welcome home, Master

00:00:35.330 --> 00:00:37.290
Welcome home, Mistress

00:00:37.670 --> 00:00:40.330
Welcome home, Master

00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:42.540
Omelet fully loaded with chicken and rice

00:00:42.540 --> 00:00:44.420
Make it yummy, moe moe kyun

00:00:48.080 --> 00:00:49.790
With plenty of milk and plenty of love

00:00:49.790 --> 00:00:51.630
Let's cast a spell, moe moe kyun

00:00:55.210 --> 00:00:58.880
Seeing sooo many masters here makes me so happy, oink!

00:00:58.880 --> 00:01:00.330
Fresh out of Moe Moe Forest

00:01:00.330 --> 00:01:02.000
This maid's going whole hog, oink!

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:04.380
Welcome home, Master

00:01:04.380 --> 00:01:06.420
Kawaii is justice, oink!

00:01:06.420 --> 00:01:09.460
My makeup's just the bomb, like, O.M.G.!

00:01:09.630 --> 00:01:12.960
Ramen, extra veggies, topped with sauce, fat, and garlic aplenty

00:01:12.960 --> 00:01:15.170
Welcome home to the pigsty!

00:01:16.540 --> 00:01:19.080
Hey! (Yeah!) This is my maid way! (Whoo!)

00:01:19.080 --> 00:01:21.830
Shot through your heart like, Boom! Boom! Boom! (Alright!)

00:01:21.830 --> 00:01:23.790
Take an instax with the scumbag

00:01:23.790 --> 00:01:26.250
Hey! (Yeah!) Maid princesses from Hell! (Whoo!)

00:01:26.250 --> 00:01:28.880
Stan for me or, Blam! Blam! Blam! (Okay)

00:01:28.880 --> 00:01:30.920
Petticoats whirl in a scuffle

00:01:30.920 --> 00:01:32.670
Hide-and-seek at the maid cafe

00:01:32.670 --> 00:01:34.380
Nice service for booming sales

00:01:34.380 --> 00:01:36.170
Falling in love is a big no-no

00:01:36.170 --> 00:01:38.500
A cutesy garden of secrets

00:01:40.830 --> 00:01:41.830
Yes!

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:44.920
He did not have the figurine on him.

00:01:46.170 --> 00:01:47.960
He says he already sold it.

00:01:48.630 --> 00:01:50.250
To a man named Kijima.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:53.710
That's what he said.

00:01:54.790 --> 00:01:57.330
Oinky Doink Cafe

00:01:57.330 --> 00:02:01.170
The Worth of a Maid's Fist and Pancreas!

00:02:04.330 --> 00:02:06.040
U-um...

00:02:07.460 --> 00:02:09.670
Would one of these help?

00:02:10.710 --> 00:02:13.080
I thought your hair might be in the way.

00:02:14.540 --> 00:02:15.540
Oh...

00:02:16.080 --> 00:02:18.830
Use whichever one you'd like.

00:02:19.460 --> 00:02:20.670
I shall borrow this one.

00:02:20.670 --> 00:02:22.710
Uh no, just take it.

00:02:23.880 --> 00:02:25.290
Much appreciated.

00:02:27.250 --> 00:02:29.290
Come to Oinky Doink Cafe!

00:02:31.290 --> 00:02:33.080
Please come to our cafe!

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:36.290
Did something good happen?

00:02:36.630 --> 00:02:37.630
Nerula!

00:02:37.960 --> 00:02:39.960
Yes, kind of.

00:02:40.790 --> 00:02:44.080
Hey, don't you bother us civilians!

00:02:44.460 --> 00:02:47.040
Jeez, a maid just tried to give me a flyer!

00:02:47.040 --> 00:02:48.420
What if she kills me?

00:02:50.290 --> 00:02:53.830
Oh Gracey-poo, what an unruly town this is!

00:02:53.830 --> 00:02:56.170
Um, who are those people?

00:02:56.170 --> 00:02:58.170
They're from an anime figurine company.

00:02:58.500 --> 00:03:01.670
I've heard they're known for
handling premium figurine deals.

00:03:02.290 --> 00:03:04.000
Show me the dummy.

00:03:05.750 --> 00:03:07.790
Yes, that will do.

00:03:07.790 --> 00:03:09.790
An amateur won't see the difference.

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:13.000
We'll sell that to Taira for a high price.

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:15.750
Gracey-poo, don't you worry!

00:03:15.750 --> 00:03:18.460
I won't let anyone touch you!

00:03:18.790 --> 00:03:20.880
It's best to stay away from them.

00:03:23.130 --> 00:03:24.580
The hell d'ya want?!

00:03:25.080 --> 00:03:26.880
Looking for a rom-ham-tic time?

00:03:27.380 --> 00:03:29.130
Come to Oinky Doink Cafe.

00:03:33.500 --> 00:03:35.960
You think I'd be intimidated by some damn maid?

00:03:36.250 --> 00:03:39.170
I could take over your sorry little cafe, just like that.

00:03:39.750 --> 00:03:41.290
Damn maid?

00:03:44.210 --> 00:03:46.210
Should a maid be initiating violence?

00:03:46.830 --> 00:03:48.500
It's BECAUSE I'm a maid.

00:03:48.500 --> 00:03:49.540
What?

00:03:49.540 --> 00:03:54.540
An Akiba maid can't simply back down
after an affront like this.

00:03:55.330 --> 00:03:57.380
Maids should be cute by nature.

00:03:57.380 --> 00:03:59.880
You cannot possibly be a maid.

00:04:00.290 --> 00:04:01.630
You, foreigner...

00:04:01.630 --> 00:04:03.380
Were you sent by Taira?

00:04:03.830 --> 00:04:05.580
I am here to escort you, sir.

00:04:07.540 --> 00:04:09.790
I refuse to acknowledge you as a maid.

00:04:16.330 --> 00:04:18.290
R-Ranko...

00:04:22.830 --> 00:04:25.290
You all look awfully chipper.

00:04:25.290 --> 00:04:29.330
Even though you've hardly paid back
any of the sweets money you've built up.

00:04:32.380 --> 00:04:34.040
Given how much trouble you're causing,

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:37.540
you can't complain no matter
what kind of job we ask you to do.

00:04:37.540 --> 00:04:38.540
Hey!

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:42.210
Then it's time to talk busine-

00:04:42.210 --> 00:04:44.500
Hey, how much water d'ya expect me to drink, dipshit?!

00:04:44.500 --> 00:04:46.500
The damn liquid's sloshing around in my gut!

00:04:46.750 --> 00:04:49.790
Wanna see me spew it out like the Merlion fountain?!

00:04:50.130 --> 00:04:51.380
But hold on...

00:04:51.380 --> 00:04:53.460
That's quite a body you've got.

00:04:53.710 --> 00:04:54.710
Manager!

00:04:54.710 --> 00:04:55.920
Yes, whatever you say!

00:04:55.920 --> 00:04:59.210
There's a job that's highly appropriate for her.

00:04:59.460 --> 00:05:01.080
Let us go negotiate terms.

00:05:01.080 --> 00:05:03.250
I bet it's another high-risk job.

00:05:03.500 --> 00:05:05.630
Well, don't you worry.

00:05:06.130 --> 00:05:09.790
I can't call myself a manager if I can't protect my staff.

00:05:12.540 --> 00:05:13.790
One last thing...

00:05:14.630 --> 00:05:19.630
The eggs in the fridge are past their expiration date,
but they're still good to go.

00:05:29.630 --> 00:05:31.670
Um, where's Ranko?

00:05:31.880 --> 00:05:33.460
She went straight to the venue.

00:05:33.790 --> 00:05:35.130
We'd better head over, too.

00:05:35.580 --> 00:05:39.750
We'll cross Mansei Bridge in the opposite direction
toward a successful tomorrow!

00:05:40.380 --> 00:05:42.500
So you made her take on the job, after all.

00:05:42.500 --> 00:05:43.500
Huh?!

00:05:43.500 --> 00:05:46.380
But you said a manager's
supposed to protect her staff!

00:05:46.580 --> 00:05:48.290
The wind's blowing our way.

00:05:48.750 --> 00:05:50.210
Ranko's on board, too.

00:05:50.210 --> 00:05:52.540
Fine, so where are we going?

00:05:52.830 --> 00:05:55.540
The Akiba Fluffy n' Sweet Club.

00:05:52.830 --> 00:05:57.790
The Akiba Fluffy n' Sweet Club

00:05:55.540 --> 00:05:57.790
Aww, how cute!

00:05:58.080 --> 00:06:00.330
Is the job like, a live gig or something?

00:06:00.330 --> 00:06:01.420
That's right.

00:06:01.420 --> 00:06:03.790
One that pumps you chock-full of adrenaline.

00:06:10.290 --> 00:06:11.290
Hi-yah!

00:06:11.290 --> 00:06:12.380
Die!

00:06:14.830 --> 00:06:17.540
Damn it! Do you know how much I bet on you?!

00:06:18.250 --> 00:06:23.130
This is the Akiba Fluffy n' Sweet Club?

00:06:26.710 --> 00:06:28.790
'Kay, do your job as seconds.

00:06:30.710 --> 00:06:31.920
Ranko?!

00:06:31.920 --> 00:06:33.580
Don't tell me you're competing?

00:06:34.170 --> 00:06:35.750
I shall do my best.

00:06:35.750 --> 00:06:38.170
What? A maid shouldn't have to do this!

00:06:38.460 --> 00:06:42.000
Striving for the sake of her cafe is what a maid does.

00:06:44.080 --> 00:06:47.210
Ranko Mannen will lose in the third round by knockout...

00:06:47.540 --> 00:06:49.630
without fail, exactly as you wish.

00:06:50.040 --> 00:06:51.250
Ashtray.

00:06:51.460 --> 00:06:52.460
Right here.

00:06:53.170 --> 00:06:54.710
I practice a special breathing technique.

00:06:56.710 --> 00:06:57.710
Hot!

00:07:00.920 --> 00:07:04.960
If you don't want an eyepatch on your other eye too,
you'd better deliver.

00:07:04.960 --> 00:07:06.170
Madam Taira...

00:07:06.670 --> 00:07:08.960
Kijima is here to show you a figurine.

00:07:09.080 --> 00:07:10.080
Rigged?!

00:07:10.080 --> 00:07:11.750
Dude, not so loud!

00:07:11.750 --> 00:07:14.750
You mean we're supposed to lose and
take the compensation?

00:07:14.750 --> 00:07:17.420
Not just that.
We know the outcome, right?

00:07:17.420 --> 00:07:19.630
So we'll bet on the opponent and rake in the profits!

00:07:19.630 --> 00:07:22.380
Honestly, our chief's a genius.

00:07:23.670 --> 00:07:25.130
Hmm...

00:07:25.960 --> 00:07:28.460
I see a new face is up against the champ.

00:07:29.290 --> 00:07:30.790
That intimidating presence...

00:07:31.290 --> 00:07:33.380
This maid, Ranko, looks promising.

00:07:34.630 --> 00:07:39.750
But Pure Milky Masami's the uncontested reigning
champion despite those delicate arms!

00:07:39.750 --> 00:07:43.380
She's in peak condition to win this
third consecutive championship.

00:07:45.290 --> 00:07:47.040
It's gonna be one hell of a fight!

00:07:47.040 --> 00:07:47.920
I'm gonna crush my opponent to a pulp again!

00:07:47.920 --> 00:07:50.040
U-uncontested champion?
I'm gonna crush my opponent to a pulp again!

00:07:50.580 --> 00:07:51.790
That girl?

00:07:58.920 --> 00:08:01.790
You're extremely fortunate, Ms. Taira.

00:08:01.790 --> 00:08:05.000
This is an item you'll never see out on the market.

00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:07.380
We just managed to acquire one ourselves.

00:08:07.380 --> 00:08:08.790
Gracey-poo!

00:08:09.170 --> 00:08:10.880
Grace Inomata...

00:08:11.170 --> 00:08:14.210
A character from the anime
"Legendary Fighter Nobuaki."

00:08:14.210 --> 00:08:16.790
She's one of my favorites, too.

00:08:17.830 --> 00:08:19.460
Though still in grade school,

00:08:19.460 --> 00:08:22.670
she's an exceptional mentor
who supports Nobuaki's development.

00:08:23.130 --> 00:08:28.210
Her devotion inspired me so much as a young child.

00:08:28.960 --> 00:08:33.420
But she's as minor as a subcharacter can get.

00:08:34.040 --> 00:08:36.920
There were very few figurines made to begin with...

00:08:37.330 --> 00:08:40.830
And that scarcity jacked her price up,

00:08:40.830 --> 00:08:44.040
easily beyond the ten million yen mark.

00:08:44.040 --> 00:08:46.080
I'll pay any price.

00:08:46.500 --> 00:08:51.880
It's only because of my admiration for her
that I managed to train up the star fighter out there.

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:01.000
Yes!

00:09:01.420 --> 00:09:02.420
Wait...

00:09:02.420 --> 00:09:04.790
Wh-wh-why on earth did you win?!

00:09:04.790 --> 00:09:06.000
Only just barely.

00:09:06.000 --> 00:09:08.420
In the first round, KO in a single punch?!

00:09:08.420 --> 00:09:09.420
Only just barely.

00:09:09.420 --> 00:09:10.670
What do you mean?!

00:09:10.670 --> 00:09:13.000
I told you a dozen times to lose in the third round!

00:09:13.420 --> 00:09:18.080
Now that I've been in the ring,
I realize that I have difficulty pulling my punches.

00:09:18.080 --> 00:09:20.460
It's contrary to how I've lived my life.

00:09:21.130 --> 00:09:22.170
How odd.

00:09:22.170 --> 00:09:25.670
Was the opponent unaware of the deal?

00:09:26.080 --> 00:09:29.960
It must be tough creating a star in a world
where strength is everything, hmm?

00:09:30.540 --> 00:09:33.630
In any case, about the price for Gracey-poo...

00:09:37.080 --> 00:09:38.670
M-ma'am...

00:09:38.670 --> 00:09:41.080
This would have happened either way.

00:09:41.500 --> 00:09:43.250
Now bring me those pigheads!

00:09:45.500 --> 00:09:47.330
So, uh...

00:09:48.290 --> 00:09:51.830
I'm asking if you realize what the hell you've done?!

00:09:51.830 --> 00:09:53.130
I have a dream!

00:09:53.130 --> 00:09:53.960
Huh?

00:09:53.960 --> 00:09:57.750
I want to buy a cottage in Hawaii and live there
surrounded by pretty boys without having to work!

00:09:57.750 --> 00:09:59.960
So please, give us another chance!

00:10:00.080 --> 00:10:02.420
I'll get Ranko to win through to the finals!

00:10:02.420 --> 00:10:04.540
She'll totally wipe out the competition!

00:10:05.130 --> 00:10:06.880
And why should I want her to win?

00:10:06.880 --> 00:10:10.170
When the crowd is dead sure
Ranko's going to win it all,

00:10:10.170 --> 00:10:12.210
she'll get her ass whooped in the final match!

00:10:12.210 --> 00:10:14.540
That's the moment your fighter will be a star!

00:10:14.540 --> 00:10:17.040
Please let us help you create a new sensation!

00:10:17.540 --> 00:10:18.880
You can rig the match, right?!

00:10:18.880 --> 00:10:19.880
Probably.

00:10:19.880 --> 00:10:21.290
You wanna rig the match, right?

00:10:21.290 --> 00:10:22.290
Not particularly.

00:10:22.290 --> 00:10:24.040
Just lose the finals!
You got that, right?!

00:10:24.040 --> 00:10:25.250
In theory.

00:10:25.250 --> 00:10:26.580
What do you say?!

00:10:26.580 --> 00:10:29.130
See how committed Ranko here is?

00:10:31.290 --> 00:10:32.500
Okay, fine.

00:10:32.500 --> 00:10:33.710
Get in here!

00:10:37.040 --> 00:10:40.380
She's a deficient maid who can't even smile,

00:10:40.380 --> 00:10:42.460
but she has fighting skills from her military experience.

00:10:42.750 --> 00:10:46.040
This dirtbag of yours can't win,
even if she messes with the plan.

00:10:46.630 --> 00:10:48.080
So you're a maid, too.

00:10:48.750 --> 00:10:50.790
I simply dressed like a maid.

00:10:51.170 --> 00:10:53.250
Neither you nor I are true maids.

00:10:53.250 --> 00:10:54.250
No.

00:10:54.420 --> 00:10:58.750
Once you put a uniform on,
anyone has the right to be a maid.

00:10:58.750 --> 00:11:02.460
The only judge that determines
whether you're a maid or not is yourself.

00:11:04.540 --> 00:11:06.960
I'll go along with that plan of yours.

00:11:07.130 --> 00:11:08.130
Hey, you!

00:11:08.420 --> 00:11:12.080
Go shove this body into the car in the parking lot.

00:11:12.080 --> 00:11:13.420
Understood.

00:11:19.420 --> 00:11:21.830
And why are you naked?

00:11:21.830 --> 00:11:23.170
To show my sincerity!

00:11:41.500 --> 00:11:43.420
You still have to fight?!

00:11:43.670 --> 00:11:46.040
It was my blunder, after all.

00:11:46.040 --> 00:11:48.830
We're gonna cross Mansei Bridge
in the opposite direction

00:11:48.830 --> 00:11:50.250
toward a successful tomorrow.

00:11:50.250 --> 00:11:52.000
You're scheming again.

00:11:52.000 --> 00:11:54.250
For the first step toward tomorrow...

00:11:55.000 --> 00:11:56.210
Let's go.

00:11:56.210 --> 00:11:57.540
ORGANS    Fizzle Fizzle Plop

00:11:57.130 --> 00:11:58.330
What are these?

00:11:57.540 --> 00:12:00.500
I Want to Borrow Your Pancreas

00:11:58.330 --> 00:12:00.460
You can borrow money with your organs as collateral.

00:12:00.460 --> 00:12:01.460
Organs?!

00:12:00.500 --> 00:12:05.630
Entrail Chargers

00:12:01.460 --> 00:12:02.750
We just have to win!

00:12:02.750 --> 00:12:05.630
And even if we lose, you apparently only need like,
half a stomach to survive anyway.

00:12:05.630 --> 00:12:08.630
For real?!
That's like borrowing money for free!

00:12:09.000 --> 00:12:10.960
Would you take a stomach and lung combo?

00:12:11.290 --> 00:12:15.580
I'm witnessing a legend in the making, right here.

00:12:15.920 --> 00:12:18.710
It's the birth of a new star!

00:12:20.750 --> 00:12:23.250
She has to fight to rig the match?

00:12:23.250 --> 00:12:25.080
We might as well cheer her on.

00:12:25.080 --> 00:12:26.920
Ranko's breaking her neck in there.

00:12:26.920 --> 00:12:27.750
QUARTERFINALS

00:12:30.460 --> 00:12:31.290
SEMIFINALS

00:12:37.040 --> 00:12:38.040
Hey, hold on!

00:12:38.040 --> 00:12:39.250
Ms. Taira!

00:12:39.250 --> 00:12:41.130
Have you seen our president?

00:12:41.130 --> 00:12:44.080
He disappeared after you asked to see him!

00:12:44.420 --> 00:12:48.830
He never came here,
but we did find this on our security camera.

00:12:49.500 --> 00:12:50.540
Boss!

00:12:51.130 --> 00:12:53.170
The bitch! Should we take her out?

00:12:53.170 --> 00:12:55.790
That would interrupt the tournament.

00:12:55.790 --> 00:12:58.000
Let us handle this matter.

00:12:58.000 --> 00:12:58.830
Huh?

00:12:58.830 --> 00:13:01.960
I promise to satisfy your thirst for vengeance,

00:13:02.290 --> 00:13:03.830
in the final ring.

00:13:06.290 --> 00:13:08.290
A dead maid tells no tales.

00:13:08.500 --> 00:13:12.880
Die with the blame for this missing figurine
on your shoulders, Ranko Mannen.

00:13:13.250 --> 00:13:15.790
You've told Zoya to pummel her to death?

00:13:15.790 --> 00:13:20.080
Yes, but Ranko Mannen is requesting to see you.

00:13:20.380 --> 00:13:22.460
She says she has something for you.

00:13:23.460 --> 00:13:25.040
Go hurl some salt at her.

00:13:38.250 --> 00:13:42.000
The only judge that determines
whether you're a maid or not is yourself.

00:13:44.670 --> 00:13:47.000
When we give the signal, take her out.

00:13:50.460 --> 00:13:53.670
Listen, only a monkey makes the same mistake twice!

00:13:53.670 --> 00:13:55.130
No counterstrikes!

00:13:55.130 --> 00:13:56.880
Take any punches that come your way!

00:13:56.880 --> 00:13:59.540
You're gonna lose!
You've gotta lose!

00:13:59.540 --> 00:14:01.000
In which round?

00:14:01.000 --> 00:14:02.040
The twelfth round.

00:14:02.040 --> 00:14:03.040
Right!

00:14:03.040 --> 00:14:04.830
You can do this!
You can lose!

00:14:04.830 --> 00:14:06.540
All right! Get out there with confidence!

00:14:06.540 --> 00:14:07.540
I will.

00:14:09.630 --> 00:14:11.250
Here it is!

00:14:11.250 --> 00:14:14.080
The final match between two monster rookies!

00:14:14.080 --> 00:14:17.460
An MMA fight with twelve rounds!
It's insane!

00:14:17.960 --> 00:14:22.880
The odds are stacked in Ranko Mannen's favor
but I doubt it'll play out that smoothly.

00:14:23.330 --> 00:14:27.380
Damn, I don't have enough organs to bet all I want!

00:14:27.750 --> 00:14:29.500
Lose for the cafe.

00:14:29.500 --> 00:14:31.000
For the cafe...

00:14:42.500 --> 00:14:43.710
Impressive.

00:14:44.460 --> 00:14:46.210
I couldn't see her punches.

00:14:46.830 --> 00:14:49.080
She has to keep taking those blows?!

00:14:51.420 --> 00:14:53.040
Are you not going to strike back?

00:14:57.290 --> 00:14:59.290
Nice! Very nice!

00:14:59.290 --> 00:15:02.750
I can see tomorrow dawning!
Just keep this up to the end!

00:15:02.750 --> 00:15:05.080
She can't!
Not for eleven rounds!

00:15:05.920 --> 00:15:07.170
That woman...

00:15:07.500 --> 00:15:09.170
You've got the go-ahead; do it.

00:15:09.380 --> 00:15:10.580
Khorosho (Okay).

00:15:17.630 --> 00:15:20.960
MMA 101

00:15:17.830 --> 00:15:19.210
Huh? The back of the head?!

00:15:19.210 --> 00:15:22.000
That's, uh, a nut!
A nut shot!

00:15:22.000 --> 00:15:23.580
Nope, not a nut shot.

00:15:28.380 --> 00:15:30.000
What? Hey, referee!

00:15:31.420 --> 00:15:32.630
Now die!

00:15:36.580 --> 00:15:37.580
Ranko!

00:15:42.750 --> 00:15:45.210
Hey! Did you just try to strike back?!

00:15:45.210 --> 00:15:46.210
No.

00:15:46.210 --> 00:15:47.540
Maybe you should stop.

00:15:47.540 --> 00:15:49.580
She's coming for the kill, for sure.

00:15:49.580 --> 00:15:50.580
She is not!

00:15:50.580 --> 00:15:51.830
Ranko can do this!

00:15:51.830 --> 00:15:53.460
I can see Hawaii coming my way!

00:15:53.460 --> 00:15:57.420
Don't you realize Ranko's about to be killed
for some petty cash?!

00:15:57.880 --> 00:16:00.960
No problem.
I won't take any more of those hits.

00:16:01.710 --> 00:16:04.670
The winds are blowing our way!
The winds of Waikiki!

00:16:18.460 --> 00:16:19.460
Ranko!

00:16:23.380 --> 00:16:25.960
So battered and worn, and you call yourself a maid?

00:16:26.420 --> 00:16:28.170
I'm an Oinky Doink maid.

00:16:28.540 --> 00:16:31.250
Your cafe is full of would-be maids, then?

00:16:31.250 --> 00:16:32.250
Excuse me?

00:16:33.210 --> 00:16:38.420
I'm saying anyone who acknowledges you
as a maid must be crap, just like you!

00:16:52.380 --> 00:16:53.630
Bastard...

00:16:53.880 --> 00:16:55.960
R-R-Ranko?!

00:16:55.960 --> 00:16:59.080
What the heck?!
Only a monkey makes the same-

00:16:59.210 --> 00:17:00.670
Uh, hey! Okachimachi?!

00:17:00.670 --> 00:17:02.750
Ack! Stop that! Hey! Ranko?

00:17:02.750 --> 00:17:03.750
Ranko...
Ranko!

00:17:03.750 --> 00:17:05.580
I must apologize.
Rankoooooo!

00:17:05.750 --> 00:17:06.960
Your hair tie...

00:17:06.960 --> 00:17:09.080
Do you have a spare one in your pouch?

00:17:09.080 --> 00:17:10.830
Oh! I have one!

00:17:14.000 --> 00:17:15.130
Sorry for the hassle.

00:17:15.380 --> 00:17:16.380
Um...

00:17:20.080 --> 00:17:21.290
Huh?

00:17:21.790 --> 00:17:23.000
Isn't this...

00:17:26.960 --> 00:17:28.420
You're ready to fight now?

00:17:28.420 --> 00:17:31.130
You can't spit on our cafe's good name...

00:17:31.500 --> 00:17:33.210
and get away with it!

00:17:35.880 --> 00:17:37.460
Because I'm a maid.

00:17:55.380 --> 00:17:56.710
This wasn't the deal!

00:17:56.920 --> 00:17:58.670
Those rotten pigheads!

00:17:58.670 --> 00:17:59.920
O-oh crap!

00:17:59.920 --> 00:18:01.630
My pancreas! My pancreas!

00:18:01.630 --> 00:18:04.670
Come on, please lose, Ranko.

00:18:05.380 --> 00:18:07.040
<i>What is her deal?</i>

00:18:07.630 --> 00:18:10.040
<i>Can she really be called a maid?</i>

00:18:11.380 --> 00:18:14.790
<i>I was always denied cute things from an early age.</i>

00:18:16.040 --> 00:18:18.460
<i>That was then I discovered the world of maid cafes,</i>

00:18:18.460 --> 00:18:19.920
<i>and aspired to become a maid myself.</i>

00:18:20.290 --> 00:18:22.670
<i>But the maids I envisioned in my mind...</i>

00:18:23.250 --> 00:18:25.290
<i>didn't reek of blood like this!</i>

00:18:26.580 --> 00:18:30.250
<i>They were all brightness and sparkles...</i>

00:18:31.420 --> 00:18:34.210
<i>and brimming with so much cuteness it was blinding.</i>

00:18:36.540 --> 00:18:37.750
<i>So why...</i>

00:18:42.500 --> 00:18:44.040
<i>She's smiling?</i>

00:18:47.580 --> 00:18:48.790
<i>But I...</i>

00:18:49.920 --> 00:18:50.920
<i>I...</i>

00:18:52.880 --> 00:18:53.540
You're gonna look great!

00:18:53.540 --> 00:18:54.420
Just smile!
You're gonna look great!

00:18:54.420 --> 00:18:55.420
Trial

00:18:54.420 --> 00:18:55.420
Shift

00:18:56.540 --> 00:18:58.460
Jeez, can't you act cuter?

00:18:59.040 --> 00:19:01.290
You're not cut out to be a maid!

00:19:02.380 --> 00:19:05.040
<i>But I don't know how to smile!</i>

00:19:07.130 --> 00:19:08.670
I won't have it!

00:19:09.040 --> 00:19:12.000
You aren't cute, at all!

00:19:13.170 --> 00:19:15.330
<i>You're wrong; I am.</i>

00:19:16.040 --> 00:19:21.330
<i>Especially today, because I'm wearing
this hair tie I received from Nagomi.</i>

00:19:29.380 --> 00:19:32.750
<i>If I win against her,
will that help me acknowledge myself?</i>

00:19:33.630 --> 00:19:37.710
<i>If, like her, I can call myself cute?!</i>

00:19:40.750 --> 00:19:42.080
<i>Shall we?</i>

00:19:42.080 --> 00:19:43.290
Vmeste (Together)!

00:19:50.000 --> 00:19:51.000
Ranko...

00:19:53.040 --> 00:19:54.380
Ranko!

00:19:54.710 --> 00:19:56.330
Go for the win!

00:20:06.790 --> 00:20:10.250
<i>Ranko, you're very cute.</i>

00:20:11.670 --> 00:20:12.880
<i>As are you.</i>

00:20:17.000 --> 00:20:18.210
<i>Cheburashka...</i>

00:20:17.000 --> 00:20:18.210
NOTE: A popular Russin cartoon character,

00:20:17.000 --> 00:20:18.210
so named because he tumbled out of a crate.

00:20:21.580 --> 00:20:22.790
Ranko...

00:20:23.080 --> 00:20:24.080
Uh?!

00:20:25.710 --> 00:20:26.920
No, don't!

00:20:33.420 --> 00:20:36.670
M-my pancreas, my spleen...

00:20:37.080 --> 00:20:39.580
Those pieces of shit!
Don't let them out alive!

00:20:40.380 --> 00:20:42.750
We found this note posted in the hallway.

00:20:43.250 --> 00:20:48.000
"Ms. Taira, there's something I would like to tell you
about the body you had me take care of."

00:20:48.250 --> 00:20:51.170
That means our president came here.

00:20:51.170 --> 00:20:53.330
You must have killed him!

00:20:58.290 --> 00:21:00.170
You sold off your organs?!

00:21:00.790 --> 00:21:04.420
The pancreas is just decorative, y'know...
I'm all burned out, down to ashes, pure white ashes.

00:21:04.920 --> 00:21:09.420
Hey, listen, that Kijima guy made a fortune
off of premium figurines, right?

00:21:09.420 --> 00:21:11.830
Y-yes, apparently.

00:21:12.670 --> 00:21:14.580
Maybe we can sell this off?

00:21:15.380 --> 00:21:18.040
Oinky Doink Cafe

00:21:15.880 --> 00:21:17.540
Well, that was all for nothing.

00:21:17.790 --> 00:21:19.420
We didn't manage to pay off

00:21:19.420 --> 00:21:21.460
any of our overdue sweets money.

00:21:21.460 --> 00:21:24.710
Just be glad you got to keep your organs!

00:21:24.710 --> 00:21:26.750
Lamenting won't get us to tomorrow!

00:21:26.920 --> 00:21:29.670
Striking it rich starts one step at a time.

00:21:29.880 --> 00:21:32.250
For starters, I got some extra manpower!

00:21:34.000 --> 00:21:37.670
I'm the new maid joining Oinky Doink
strting today, Zoya!

00:21:37.670 --> 00:21:41.040
I'll do my very best to become a cute maid!

00:21:41.330 --> 00:21:42.790
Th-the one from yesterday!

00:21:42.790 --> 00:21:44.420
Are you really the same person?

00:21:44.420 --> 00:21:46.750
This is the true, real me!

00:21:47.580 --> 00:21:49.670
An overseas hire, huh?!

00:21:49.670 --> 00:21:51.210
Taira is dead!

00:21:51.210 --> 00:21:53.540
I got her for free, no strings attached!

00:21:53.540 --> 00:21:56.670
We've finally gone international!

00:21:58.540 --> 00:22:02.920
<i>I'm a total novice with no knowledge to speak of,
but I'll do my very best,</i>

00:22:02.920 --> 00:22:05.250
<i>so I'm counting on you to teach me, Ranko.</i>

00:22:08.210 --> 00:22:09.420
<i>It's good to have you.</i>

00:22:24.630 --> 00:22:29.540
Another day, another chance to go moe moe kyun

00:22:30.830 --> 00:22:35.960
I come to the pigsty for my moe moe kyun

00:22:36.830 --> 00:22:41.960
That's the sort of life I lead

00:22:43.170 --> 00:22:51.750
Mock me, and you just might bleed

00:22:51.750 --> 00:22:57.330
Is the hesitation that wells up

00:22:57.880 --> 00:23:06.170
The lingering scent of a humane soul?

00:23:06.790 --> 00:23:13.250
Whether you get to live or die

00:23:13.500 --> 00:23:19.080
Tread your own path

00:23:19.080 --> 00:23:25.460
Have the guts to pull that trigger

00:23:25.920 --> 00:23:31.790
Who are you

00:23:32.000 --> 00:23:38.710
Show me through the pain
